{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f2ce0c81064d70a1e82639e4cb146f2a34840b6db9a6141784a32112e9b2bd58", "ja": "（奈緒のPV撮影も折り返し。明るくてノリもいい\n奈緒のおかげで、現場にも笑みが絶えないな！）", "zh": "（奈绪的PV拍到一半了。\n多亏开朗又搞笑的她，让拍摄现场也欢笑声不断！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b5c319b70460707628c8877ee9abc775dc53db98e1a2032dd87fbbc9432e2af1", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん♪\nPVの撮影って、なんやおもろいですねっ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生♪\n拍PV很好玩耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6d5d181595fe281c47967d13e3291e98de3e1729732fca7abdca19399b44514b", "ja": "ああ、いい空気で撮れてると思う。\n後半もこの調子で頼むぞ！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得拍摄时的气氛很不错。\n后半段也拜托你照着这个步调继续啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "290c49beb92a4495cef17bf492bd2dd932c263ccd347e9b26645498c6279d30f", "ja": "はい、任しといてくださいっ。\n……あ、でも、ちょっと聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "嘿，交给我吧！\n……啊，不过，我可以问一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2443ca60642e77a649f4f62129e6ff41dd2e82468bd3bbdc56aec1ebe2caa821", "ja": "ん？　もちろんいいけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？当然可以，怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "2c6a369638e4612c8159de03651385fbfbe49d6a035dbdfa1b2da55f4f08f988", "ja": "PVって、映画とかドラマみたいに、\nお話を楽しんでもらうのとはちゃいますやんか？", "zh": "所谓的PV呀，\n跟让人享受故事情节的电影或电视剧不太一样吼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "b7f39c111f0e6e8854354ef153b5e8078b0f39f2f6daef1ca205342bde0b1f11", "ja": "PVならではの良さって、なんやろなーって思て。\n改めて考えてみたら、気になってきたんやけど……。", "zh": "我在想PV特有的优点，会是什么咧～\n这样仔细一想呀，就让人在意得不得了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6a68177a9577bbf7af5ea05234fbb91fa19e9954c9a74748f458bf9f5d73157c", "ja": "PVならではの良さか。そうだな……。", "zh": "PV特有的优点啊，我想想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d62243851cdd9660f171a85f67fa3f0de705501f1ba898ca498fa2e6812ceb36", "ja": "PVの主役は当然奈緒だからな。ファンの人に、\n奈緒を身近に感じてもらえるっていうのがひとつ。", "zh": "毕竟PV的主角理所当然是奈绪，\n所以能让粉丝感觉和奈绪比较贴近，这是一个优点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ff4e335bef4a360efe9dfcf45c08407bf3dd75e4c5dc6af29b5e5138ac1d7a00", "ja": "私を身近に……。えへへ、なんや恥ずかしいなあ……\nあ、他にもなんかあるんですか？", "zh": "感觉和我比较贴近……嘿嘿，感觉好难为情呀……\n啊，还有其他的优点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1010_p", "source_sha256": "cc33c64e65a116ce7d19250b66b5e07facb46893401668f53c268a08c22c7e6d", "ja": "PVには歌だけじゃなくて映像や物語性があるだろ？\n初めての人にも、奈緒の魅力を伝えやすいんだ。", "zh": "PV不只有歌曲，还有影像和故事性对吧？\n这样第一次接触的人，也能轻易就感受到奈绪的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1011_p", "source_sha256": "560a2600f967bcf41cd1f9a3334c68bbf059077c589a178d866acdef38054d42", "ja": "だから、奈緒のことを知らなかった人でも、すぐに\nファンになってくれるかもしれない、ってことかな。", "zh": "所以就算是不认识奈绪的人，\n也可能会马上变成粉丝，大概是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "96581406f5ae62dd737a6f6539facb05ebc9ad5caeae1a3aafaa272f32c0e2c2", "ja": "私を知らなかった人が、すぐにファンに……？\nす、すごいやないですか！", "zh": "不认识我的人会马上变成粉丝……？\n这、这样很厉害耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "2073863efa084fe5094f9be81de1f38d5026c0bb2b45aa140231e1165378a95d", "ja": "なんやおもろいわ～とか、軽く楽しんでましたけど……\nPV、めっちゃ大事やわ！　私、燃えて来ました！", "zh": "我之前想说「感觉很好玩嘛～」还很悠哉快活咧……\n结果PV根本超重要的呀！我开始热血沸腾啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d82ee37d46ba180742109b685131fe487997c8993c3534b6f416afbb7808e391", "ja": "はは、そうみたいだな。でも、無理しなくていいぞ。\nさっきの楽しそうな奈緒は、すごく魅力的だったから。", "zh": "哈哈，看得出来。不过，不必太勉强自己。\n像刚才那样感觉很开心的奈绪，就非常有魅力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c6fb16955e8c3f166697219b5dc4095db9e76d7dae62336cdaf5124edba4be8", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか？\n……えへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "是、是这样吼？\n……嘿嘿，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "c84932893a014de64c6b0b4d2c8f06680489598caa8c9c011817cd8a890dcfd9", "ja": "そしたら、べつに無理はしませんけど……\n大事なとこだけ、こそっと頑張りますね。", "zh": "既然如此，我也不会太勉强自己啦……\n但我会在重点部分偷偷加把劲喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "3d4fc7b2fa719223f7d1bc21ee10212b90bd31fd1d0e5544a670964d827d754e", "ja": "私の魅力、ファンの人にも、いろんな人にも\nもっといっぱい、知ってもらいたいですから♪", "zh": "因为我想让粉丝跟许多不同的人，\n都能感受到我满满的魅力呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a718b8ffc18f0912f935bf361949fcd9d8060ebab0ea3d2c23cdec36bec143ca", "ja": "ああ、このPVでアイドル横山奈緒のことを、\nたくさんの人に知ってもらおう！", "zh": "嗯，就用这支PV，\n让更多人认识偶像横山奈绪吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "de5e3fd54398b57b5ebeba6ce374b37802705c3c523157de28c003623c09650d", "ja": "えへへ。いっぱい魅力を広めて、\nいつか人気が出すぎて、めっちゃ忙しくなっても……", "zh": "嘿嘿，就算哪天我的魅力传得超广，\n人气大爆炸，变成超级大忙人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0074_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "5975943b4c95281912809dab120b64f832aec723749832ad57eaefba9fabb1fd", "ja": "また今日みたいに、私のPV、いっぱい作ってな！\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "到时候还是要像今天这样，制作很多我的PV唷！\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
